OL,3,CBoy, 12, dies after falling from barn
OL,4,Croof
OL,6,FA 12-year-old boy has died after
OL,7,Ffalling from the roof of a barn in
OL,8,FCounty Durham.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fincident at at Woodhouses, near Bishop
OL,12,FAuckland shortly before 2.45pm on
OL,13,FFriday 24 July.
OL,15,FThe boy, named by police as 12-year-
OL,16,Fold Jaxon Robert Hubery, had suffered
OL,17,Fserious injuries in the fall and was
OL,18,Ftaken to the Royal Victoria Infirmary
OL,19,Fin Newcastle.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/2
