OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1785383017
OL,3,CBoy, 12, dies after falling from barn
OL,4,Croof
OL,6,FHe died from his injuries on Tuesday
OL,7,F28 July.
OL,9,FHis family have thanked people for
OL,10,Ftheir love and support while Jaxon was
OL,11,Fin hospital and have urged other
OL,12,Fparents to keep their children away
OL,13,Ffrom the area.
OL,15,FDurham Constabulary say they are
OL,16,Fworking alongside the Health and
OL,17,FSafety Executive to establish the full
OL,18,Fcircumstances surrounding the incident.
